# Anyone who guesses a `/vi/` prefix means the Vietnamese page, which lives at
# the root. A 301 rather than a rewrite so the prefixed form never becomes a
# second URL for the same content.
#
# Do NOT add a catch-all (`/* /index.html 200`) here. Every route has a real
# HTML file, and a catch-all would answer every typo with the home page and a
# 200 — the soft-404 farm that dist/404.html exists to prevent.
/vi/*  /:splat  301
